pdf-equilibrist (0.1.16-2) resolute; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release: full English translation of the app UI (all
    ribbon tabs, dialogs, menus, status bar), bilingual FR/EN NSIS
    installer (Windows-only fix, no effect on this package — see 0.1.16-1).
    Also fixes app translations (.qm) never being found on a system
    package install: resource_path() only knew about assets/, not
    translations/, so the app silently stayed French regardless of the
    language picked. No dependency changes — same wheelhouse as 0.1.14.

