pdf-equilibrist (0.1.14-6) resolute; urgency=high

  * Security: strip pip from the shipped venv (CVE-2026-3219, CVE-2026-6357,
    CVE-2026-8643, CVE-2025-8869, CVE-2026-1703). The app never invokes pip
    at runtime — python3 -m venv bootstraps it via ensurepip from whatever
    version is frozen in the build chroot's system Python, which was never
    upgraded. Removed after the last pip install step in override_dh_auto_build
    rather than chasing every future pip CVE with a version bump.

 -- Paul Woisard <paulwoisard@gmail.com>  Thu, 30 Jul 2026 21:00:00 +0000

