pdf-equilibrist (0.1.14-4) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Fix FAILEDTOBUILD on the previous resolute upload (-3): the
    --find-links dual-wheelhouse pip resolution worked exactly as
    designed (all 22 version-locked deps correctly resolved to their
    cp314 wheels), but installing our own package failed with
    "BackendUnavailable: Cannot import 'setuptools.build_meta'" —
    python3-setuptools/python3-wheel were never listed in
    debian/control's Build-Depends; noble's chroot happened to already
    have them, resolute's fresh chroot did not. Added explicitly.

 -- Paul Woisard <paulwoisard@gmail.com>  Tue, 28 Jul 2026 21:45:00 +0000

pdf-equilibrist (0.1.14-3) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Build for Ubuntu 26.04 LTS (resolute) — Python 3.14. Six wheelhouse
    wheels are version-locked C extensions (cffi, charset_normalizer,
    fonttools, lxml, numpy, pillow) and were regenerated for cp314 via
    cross-platform `pip download`; the other 17 are py3-generic or abi3
    and reused unchanged from the noble wheelhouse.
    NOTE: this revision FAILEDTOBUILD, see -4 for the fix.

