pdf-equilibrist (0.1.14-2) oracular; urgency=medium

  * Rebuild for Ubuntu 24.10 (oracular) ahead of noble's eventual EOL — same
    Python 3.12 ABI as noble, no source or wheelhouse changes needed.
    NOTE: oracular reached end-of-life 2025-07-10, this upload was a
    mistake (not checked before building) and was likely rejected by
    Launchpad since the series is archived — do not repeat for
    non-LTS/EOL series without checking support status first. Plucky
    (25.04) is also already EOL (2026-01-17) and should not be targeted
    either. Only LTS series (noble, resolute, and future LTS releases)
    are worth the ongoing multi-series maintenance effort.

 -- Paul Woisard <paulwoisard@gmail.com>  Mon, 27 Jul 2026 21:00:00 +0000

pdf-equilibrist (0.1.14-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Fix CVE checker on frozen builds: the purelib-scoped dependency scan
    (added to avoid --system-site-packages noise on Linux venv packages)
    broke Windows' PyInstaller exe, which bundles dist-info metadata next
    to the executable rather than under a Lib/site-packages tree. Frozen
    builds now fall back to the unrestricted scan; this Linux package was
    never affected (it never took the frozen code path).

